          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Ja'far ibn Muhammad ibn Yunus has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Sa'd ibn Abdullah, from Ibrahim ibn Hashim, from Ja'far ibn Muhammad ibn Yunus."
        ]
      }
